This independent reproduction adds local execution and download entry points,
pinned model loading, progress reporting, numerical and termination checks,
result verification, documentation, and a retained experiment result package.
The upstream attention capture, metrics, plotting utilities, and experiment
protocol remain attributed to the original project.

The experiment uses Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B from the Qwen team:
    https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B
    Model revision: c1899de289a04d12100db370d81485cdf75e47ca

Model weights are not distributed in this repository. The download entry point
retrieves them separately from their official source.
